#: ../../source/svgo_README.md:11
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/svgo_README.md:13
msgid ""
"SVG files, especially those exported from various editors, usually "
"contain a lot of redundant and useless information. This can include "
"editor metadata, comments, hidden elements, default or non-optimal values"
" and other stuff that can be safely removed or converted without "
"affecting the SVG rendering result."
msgstr ""

